[en.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_6_ST_TO]
> Enter the Storm Tech Venue

[en.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_6_ST_TO_desc]
After the collapse of the Storm Empire, the monstrous shipyards built for conquest finally stopped their work in the clouds, while the cooperation between the Verko Corporation and Gruber made them work again. Although they themselves did not understand most of the technology, it is always good to show them off to earn some ticket money.

(There is a line of reminder below: Fragile items, do not touch, including the stone statue in the center of the exhibition hall)

[zh.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_6_ST_TO]
> 前往风暴科技会场

[zh.DECISION_C22_WORLD_EXPO_6_ST_TO_desc]
风暴帝国解体后，云层中那些原本为征服而修建的造船厂终于停下了它们的工作，而维可集团与格鲁伯的合作让它们重新运转起来。虽然他们自己也没有搞懂其中的多数科技，但是放出来展示一下赚些门票钱总是好的。

(下面写着一行提示语：易碎品，请勿触碰，包括展厅中央的石像）
